      "id": "person:inigo",
      "type": "Person",
      "name": "Íñigo Fernández del Amo Blanco",
      "description": "Acting Strategy Director at Accenture with +6 years of experience advising Tech, Telco and Banking CxOs on IT, Digital and Data & Analytics transformations. Previously worked +4 years as Researcher at Cranfield University, developing AI and AR-native full-stack applications to support maintenance and diagnosis of high-value assets. Tech Strategy Agentic Lead at Accenture developing AI-driven solutions for professional work (agentic customer data platform, B2B agentic CRM) and personal use (trading bot, agentic consulting toolkit).",
