      "id": "software:tessera",
      "type": "Software",
      "name": "Tessera",
      "description": "An agentic customer data platform built around two capabilities. The first is autonomous ingestion: agents read source databases, infer how their contents map onto a shared ontology, and assemble them into a knowledge graph without that mapping being written by hand. The second is activation on top of that graph — agentic tools and machine learning models that segment, target and hyper-personalise campaigns, each working against the graph rather than a separate extract.",
      "startDate": "2026",
      "developmentStatus": "active",
      "position": 1,
